STAR Home gaps: adult persona path, left_out/friend_left/reunion emitters, watch hearing hub

- social chat romance text and self_model persona render(romance=) / persona_for_day(romance=): romance-permitting wording
  only when rules.romance_mode allows it; friends-only text drops all flirt/romance clauses; cache key per mode
- emotion events: reunion (friend silent >= 3 days), friend_left (casual goodbye in chat or in a call), left_out
  (LeftOutWatch fed by Discord server channels); all guarded
- star.watch gets the senses hearing hub through plugins.hearing_hub / voicestack.hearing_hub (None -> captions/picture)
- tests in test_home_wiring.py and test_inner_life.py; notes docs/agents/home-gaps-20261026.md

